@page
@model CornDome.Pages.ContactModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Me / Contact";
}

<div class="mb-3">
    <h1 style="border-bottom: 1px solid lightgray">About Me</h1>
    <p>
        I am Derrick, a software engineer with a passion for card games and an enjoyer of nerdy things.
        Primarily a Pokemon TCG player, I have grown bored of the competitive format and started playing other games on the side. I ventured into Magic the Gathering, Yu-Gi-Oh, even alternative formats of Pokemon but nothing really scratched my casual 1v1 itch.
    </p>
    <p>
        And then I saw it... an advertisement for the Adventure Time Card Wars kickstarter project.
        I played this card game about a decade ago with my best pal Brandon and I have very fond memories of flooping pigs.
    </p>
    <p>
        So I did what any sane card game enjoyer software developer would do. Make a fun website for it!
    </p>
</div>

<div>
    <h1 style="border-bottom: 1px solid lightgray">Contact Info</h1>
